LASS PERIOD"), OF THE IMPORTANT MARCH 22, 2021 LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE IN THE SECURITIES CLASS ACTION FIRST FILED BY THE FIRM.SO WHAT: IF YOU PURCHASED WALMART SECURITIES DURING THE CLASS PERIOD YOU MAY BE ENTITLED...'}{'symbol': 'WMT', 'date': '2021-02-03 14:50:00', 'title': 'WMT DEADLINE: PAWAR LAW GROUP ANNOUNCES A SECURITIES CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST WALMART INC.– WMT', 'text': 'NEW YORK, FEB. 03, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- PAWAR LAW GROUP ANNOUNCES A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS WHO PURCHASED SHARES OF \xa0WALMART INC. (NYSE: WMT) FROM MARCH 30, 2016 THROUGH DECEMBER 22, 2020, INCLUSIVE (THE “CLASS PERIOD”). THE LAWSUIT SEEKS TO RECOVER DAMAGES FOR WALMART INC. INVESTORS UNDER THE FEDERAL SECURITIES LAWS.'}